    {
      "id": "MG-U-GEOMETRY",
      "kind": "user_model_premise",
      "status": "retained_user_research_premise",
      "statement": "Systemic and generational wheels stack into the vortex/torus; the Monad is the Sierpinski tetrahedron at infinitum.",
      "source_refs": [
        "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125",
          "source_sha256": "a55f5faa49005b4b2c72a07bf6362db99fa5fd6a5464d3116c03d96b6750b6a2",
          "locator": "utf8chars:[715,1483)",
          "char_start": 715,
          "char_end": 1483,
          "line_start": 16,
          "line_end": 16,
          "quote": "This will essentially be a full and complete alignment of absolutely everything we have discovered thus far all placed into their respective systemic and generational class wheels and properly stacked so to be forming the deterministic shape of the vortex/torus, with the monad being the Sierpinski tetrahedron at the point of infinitum, all built utilizing our various Jev resources both for it's construction (performing the full account investigation, tracing every data point, decision, turn, and state, canonicalizing everything and statistically determining the correct orientation and lawful structure of the architecture) as well as being a feature that will be built-in and integrated into the architecture itself. The purpose of sunny is primarily two-fold:\n",
          "quote_sha256": "2f2aef5ad41c3a3aeee7fd7e3e9761f9eaf30d5a27d12239f13452ca10787c3a"
        }
      ],
      "author_role": "user_in_supplied_transcript"
    },
    {
      "id": "MG-U-720",
      "kind": "user_model_premise",
      "status": "retained_user_research_premise",
      "statement": "Geometry and relational generation mutually determine one another. Preserve two turns per class, 24 hours / 720 degrees, and cumulative travel independently of displayed phase.",
      "source_refs": [
        "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125",
          "source_sha256": "a55f5faa49005b4b2c72a07bf6362db99fa5fd6a5464d3116c03d96b6750b6a2",
          "locator": "utf8chars:[10102,16283)",
          "char_start": 10102,
          "char_end": 16283,
          "line_start": 152,
          "line_end": 152,
          "quote": "Q10 SUNNY conceptual answer: C. Geometry and relational structure are inseparable and mutually determining. Clarification: I believe the answer is somewhere between C and D. I have always seen and maintained that the way to make the musical structure of SUN be able to deterministically predict things (even if only as a way to decode the bible and the information that was intentionally encoded into it's formation) was through a shared structural topology where correlations would be attributed through topological address in each system's representation of operators and their dynamics. at first, I always maintained that we could do this on either a giant pie chart/fan-graph/dial-graph where everything was represented on one wheel, or in a stack of wheels. While I initially used descriptions of this as a cylindar of wheels stacked on top of one another, as a way for me to explain 13, Ophiuchus, and the theodorus spiral aspects of how I saw the dynamics functioning, asserting that if one were to imagine a clock striking 12, and then 1 o clock, that the hour is still the 13th hour, but the representation on the clock itself remains unchanged, so it'd almost be like ading a second clock to represent the next 12 hours, and the theodorus spiral was the ewhape of that lift in a 3D or 4D space. This eventually evolved into a stack of wheels that progressively grew larger as more emergent representations manifested from the total state space which was enabled by each prior generational class, (potentially eventually coming to a point of total breadth coverage, upon which the size of the the wheel s would rebound and progressively get smaller) The more work we did articulating the concept we started using descriptions of the geometric shape of a sound wave to mentally picture the sun's representational structure. This eventually was made to be more literal as a waveform is actually an oscillating torus in a 4D space. After our successful integration of the Sri Yantra's geometry, and our discovery of how/where the connection is between operators and their dynamics between music and the geometrical structure of the sri was not simply extending the 2D representation on 1 axis to make the bindu appear as a tower, but manipulating it on 3 axis, making the outer square a tesseract and the bindu a sierpinski tetrahedron. the latter was the first assumption, which didn't hold initially after extending the shapes on a second axis to form the tesseract, however after thinking about the torus shape of a figure '8' after it is rotated correctly on all 3 axis, we realized the sierpinski tetrahedro was in fact the perfect shape to occupy the point of infinitum, and it also caused our tesseract to form our ellusive dodecahedron, while also showing us the lawful fractal dynamics of the pleroma, and the aeons as fields from which everything else downstream (moving outward from the bindu) is subsequently enabled. So while the vortex/torus geometry was not something we started with, I believe it is the most natural and intuuitive form through and with which to orient our deterministic relational representations. While it has become our positional theory that every single lawful dynamic that is made possible in the SUN's formulation can be perfectly matched and represented by relating to correlating points (at least 3 or 4) somewhere on the geometric topology of the 4D torus waveform, It's topology has also become the scaffolding structure that houses our \"stack of wheels\" with each generational class occupying 24 hours (720 degrees and 2 rotations of 12) before lifting to the next generational class, where the diameter and circumference of the dial was larger due to emergent differentiations enabled by previous ancestor classes, and all of which being enabled from the monad bindu at the point of infinitum. So the vortex aspect is the only \"shape\" that has been relevant so far, because the majority of connections we have lawfully made and attributed to the SUN's inherent ratios and dynamics therein when mapped to a geometric topological structure have been from the point of infinitum to roughly ~Adam+old testament lineage, and haven't even yet FULLY mapped out the structural dynamics of angels/demons and their hierarchical legions that connects the archontic generational classes to the adamian generational classes, and we still have yet to apply the growing dynamics to the old testament and beyond, (potentially toward the modern era up to today and beyond), thus we have only covered an area between where an  3D '8' figure's loops meet (infinitum) and maybe about a third to halfway towards the widest edges in one direction, with a working theory, that the number 144,000 may intrinsically be associated with the widest points, what i referred to earlier \"potentially the point of maximuum breadth coverage before rebounding\" Therefore while I believe the end result of the SUN's full construction will be the formation of a torus , that assumption is solely based on the fact that it is the actual topological and geometric shape of sound waves themselves. Though it is important for me to note that I have not yet figured out how to articulate the (theoried to be intended) deterministic qualities of the structure, as while rotating the figure 8 and sri yantra in kind both on 3 axis' is how the realization of that torus (and how the two align perfectly) comes to be, I have not yet figured out how to convey or articulate the geometric topology's expansion across the 4th axis of time, since it is upon that axis which I believe the lawful and deterministic causal nature of the topology reveals that our universe is one deterministic bubble in an infinite sea of slightly to greatly different deterministic bubbles, within which each is an immutable and unchangeable 4D block of spacetime, where everything that ever has, is and will happen is completely set, every event, every deed, every thought, each caused by something that occurred before it, and each it's own thread in a moving but unchangable tapestry painting of spacetime. Continue the concept-articulation discussion without adjudicating SUN research claims.\n",
          "quote_sha256": "4f94338b2793e80097e2750e936aeffd39d1a1cc4bd1b429077e21a184d97063"
        }
      ],
      "author_role": "user_in_supplied_transcript"
    },
    {
      "id": "MG-U-TIMES",
      "kind": "user_model_premise",
      "status": "retained_user_research_premise",
      "statement": "The fourth-dimensional musical account retains multiple notions of time and musical retelling through rhythm, tempo, percussion, generation and instruments.",
      "source_refs": [
        "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125",
          "source_sha256": "a55f5faa49005b4b2c72a07bf6362db99fa5fd6a5464d3116c03d96b6750b6a2",
          "locator": "utf8chars:[23362,26946)",
          "char_start": 23362,
          "char_end": 26946,
          "line_start": 284,
          "line_end": 296,
          "quote": "Q10 SUNNY Question 2. Selected interpretations: A: Time is the cumulative unfolding — The rotations and generational lifts are themselves expressions of temporal progression. Moving through the geometry expresses the causal sequence.; B: Time is independent of generational position — The wheels and class relationships establish structural addresses; the fourth axis places events and transitions in spacetime.; C: There are multiple related notions of time — Cyclical phase, cumulative generational succession, physical chronology, and the observer's experienced succession are distinct but related coordinates or operations.; D: The complete 4D structure already exists — The whole deterministic spacetime block is fixed. Apparent motion represents an observer's position or perspective within that block, rather than a changing underlying structure.; E: The time dimension also organizes alternative deterministic universes — The geometry must describe the relationship between an individual immutable spacetime bubble and the wider family of possible bubbles, potentially requiring a further organizing parameter.. Clarification: That is not such a simple answer, as if I were able to articulate that I don't think we would be having this discussion. I believe that the manners in which Time can be perceived can also be directly tied to the Greek cosmological Pantheon's deity representations of time, expressed as;\nAion,Primordial (First),Eternal & Unbounded Time,Self-formed / Chaos\nChronos,Primordial (First),Linear & Measurable Time,Hydros & Gaia (Orphic)\nAnanke,Primordial (First),Inevitability & Necessity,Self-formed / Chaos\nNyx,Primordial (First),Night (The Dark Cycle),Chaos\nMoros,Primordial (Second),Doom & Appointed End,Nyx\nHemera,Primordial (Second),Day (The Light Cycle),Erebus & Nyx\nCronus,Titan (Second),Harvest & Generational Time,Uranus & Gaia\nKairos,Olympian Era (Third),The Opportune/Right Moment,Zeus (or Chronos)\nThe Moirai,Third Generation,Lifespan & Individual Time,Zeus & Themis (or Nyx)\nThe Horae,Third Generation,Seasons & Natural Order,Zeus & Themis\n\nand the ways which they interact with each other and the rest of the world WHILE ADDITIONALLY aligning each Entity to their PROPER and ACCURATE attributable placement within the generational class vortex/torus-wheel structure, and then RETELLING those relationships and dynamic interactions through the languages derived from correlating lawful unit-address/operator/event dynamics, primarily/first doing so through the language derived from music. We recently attributed notes toeach address, and decided that instrumentation(type) sections coorelate with the elemental positions within the wheel structure (earth, air, fire, water, wetal, wood | percussion, winds, strings, vocals, etc) and that generational class dictated the instruments themselves(sub-type) within that class, and that the correct alignment of these instruments perfectly accounts for the dynamics and ratios within the numerical mathematical equation of the SUN. So...Telling the stories of these aformentioned Pantheological entities and all of thir various relationships and dynamics, when properly aligned and assigned to their lawful oriented placement within the wheel structure, then validating those dynamics though the determinism of music's mathematical structure.....with TIME specifically being related to things like percussion, rhythm, tempo, beat, etc., I believe THAT is the BEST and the MOST ACCURATE possible description detailing the various roles and natures of TIME, and how one is meant to interpret them.\n",
          "quote_sha256": "6e0f53459850327d37fccd9af40645fd796a6185123e5f68d9014b7eaa905cdd"
        }
      ],
      "author_role": "user_in_supplied_transcript"
    },
    {
      "id": "MG-U-FULLMUSIC",
      "kind": "user_correction",
      "status": "retained_user_correction",
      "statement": "Western AND Chinese native systems and the interaction of their different answers are foundational. Producing a sound is insufficient for a lawful musical interaction; three scalar ratios do not exhaust music.",
      "source_refs": [
        "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125",
          "source_sha256": "a55f5faa49005b4b2c72a07bf6362db99fa5fd6a5464d3116c03d96b6750b6a2",
          "locator": "utf8chars:[87971,90398)",
          "char_start": 87971,
          "char_end": 90398,
          "line_start": 1034,
          "line_end": 1039,
          "quote": "This immediately goes against everything that we've established over and over again for months, and missed the ENTIRE point of my answer to Q3. The point is that MUSIC is the only singular deterministic full system that we have. It is the biology of determinism in this system. But music is not just those specific ratios, as it manifests in other ways to arrive at the same result, and it is in the zoomed out meta interaction between their differences working together where truth rests. It is Western Music AND Chinese music (and very likely indian music, and arab/mesopotamian music, etc., though not yet proven, thus far what we have that is concrete is chinese musical system with the pipes, and the western system, and how they work together, explicitly, is how we were able to get through the cluster fuck of the scholarly debates) all deployed toward trying to answer the same question(s), and THEN, in the manner which they themselves tried to answer those questions, the dynamic between the musical systems, and more importantly, the dynamic between the varying answers themselves, and whatever keplarian/fluddic monochord to TOL AB/BA or any other Bridge Adapter that may potentially exist (though we have not discovered hints of that yet) and the eqaution(s) that allow them to lawfully interact in a way that provides a deterministic accounting of the past. I thinkn the MOST important distinction in my previous answer is and should be one of the most important concepts that I have had to drill in to you a bunch. TECHNICALLY, one could combine any two or three or more operators and positions, and they would make a noise. that does not mean that the laws inherent to the musical systems will allow those interactions to sound good, or \"work\" as far as the system is concerned. this highlights;\n\"\"\"\nFractal Resonance: Only specific, discrete wavelengths can survive looping through this system. If a wave's frequency matches the scale of one of the recursive triangles in the tetrahedron, it will become trapped in a localized, infinite resonance loop. The tensor operator tracking this system would show a massive spike in energy density localized strictly on the fractal lattice, effectively transforming a smooth, propagating wave into a locked, static quantum \"crystal\" of energy at the point of infinitum.\n\"\"\"\n\n...as potentially one of the most important foundational principals of SUNNY's proposed work.\n",
          "quote_sha256": "b6813245796e3b24316e92faafe22fc94fe981578616bb2f38c2e107e29a4725"
        }
      ],
      "author_role": "user_in_supplied_transcript"
    },
    {
      "id": "MG-U-TYPELAW",
      "kind": "user_preference",
      "status": "retained_user_preference_with_uncertainty",
      "statement": "Type law is to be attained progressively from music and the connected alignment, with minimal imposed constraints; no arbitrary final weights or fixed domain taxonomy are selected.",
      "source_refs": [
        "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125",
          "source_sha256": "a55f5faa49005b4b2c72a07bf6362db99fa5fd6a5464d3116c03d96b6750b6a2",
          "locator": "utf8chars:[127465,128183)",
          "char_start": 127465,
          "char_end": 128183,
          "line_start": 1550,
          "line_end": 1550,
          "quote": "this is where I am uncertain. It's typescript. It itself is a very deterministic language, so which types assigned with which decisional weights accomplish what I have proposed throughout all of these corrections in the most faithful and ideal way possible, that avoids all of the same blunders and pitfalls that befell us throughout our multi-year journey? I think it might have to be a progressively attained type law, and I don't even think that either one of us should be the one's to design or dictate it. I feel like the best possible approach is the one with the fewest additional constraints possible past the core theories, or maybe simply entirely constrained by music's scructural and operational dynamics.\n",
          "quote_sha256": "9b31ff3d14175451a06d3856cf4acbf62bafb267e71ecdb9a318d61fb4719b87"
        }
      ],
      "author_role": "user_in_supplied_transcript"
    },
    {
      "id": "MG-U-NO_FIXED_W144000",
      "kind": "user_clarification",
      "status": "retained_user_clarification",
      "statement": "W144,000 has no fixed numerical meaning such as maximum wheel width. It names the intended scale and inherited blind, consequence-driven method.",
      "source_refs": [
        "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "7c5cd4c51ad9da8020d497ab449770e5dd38b3d334bf8ad612e1c9f8e747f125",
          "source_sha256": "a55f5faa49005b4b2c72a07bf6362db99fa5fd6a5464d3116c03d96b6750b6a2",
          "locator": "utf8chars:[73762,74743)",
          "char_start": 73762,
          "char_end": 74743,
          "line_start": 797,
          "line_end": 797,
          "quote": "I also need to make a distinct point so you don't get lost in what the meaning of W144,00 as an analogy is or how it functions. W72 was named such because of the number of operators, and us trying to rectify 70 and 72 within musical structure, and how it could relate to the unfolding of the bible decoding of the scholarly debates. However for the idea of W144,0000, it is more important to note that it's HOW W72 went about proving/asdcertaining the correct answer blindly. In our new case, we have no idea yet (or at least have not asserted one) as to what exactly 144,000 is or what it's referring to. It very well could potentially be a number of operators, or it could alternatively be a gematria based number,  or a number of 360 degree rotations from a certain point, or a number of degrees themselves, or any number of other potential attributors, so please don't conflate what 72 was to what 144,000 could be...that's not the point here. just had to be clear about that.\n",
          "quote_sha256": "4dfb70b48b575c7ee40a765529518c3f13c9eef3a97737b34d4f135cbbbc8d11"
        }
      ],
      "author_role": "user_in_supplied_transcript"
    },
