    {
      "id": "MG-LATEST-FOUNDATION",
      "kind": "direct_user_correction",
      "status": "retained_direct_user_correction",
      "statement": "The Chinese–Western bridge predates SUN, SOL, W72 and the Chinese prediction. Use it as an existing foundation rather than rediscovering it. Current polarity and musical-year questions constrain the connected model.",
      "source_refs": [
        "7d5a026c9df7d3fdf06382c966729a7cf3da22dbc4a1276c9f809f7a139ce965"
      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "7d5a026c9df7d3fdf06382c966729a7cf3da22dbc4a1276c9f809f7a139ce965",
          "source_sha256": "73b3171aa010c78121f2d7798011ce36f6e4891f4ef1409d25ed98aaca16fcfc",
          "locator": "utf8chars:[696957,700764)",
          "char_start": 696957,
          "char_end": 700764,
          "line_start": 13684,
          "line_end": 13684,
          "quote": "You're retarded and an a****** regarding number two not only did we already have that locked the f*** in before we even called this whole thing sun or sol months ago... But we also reestablished it last m************ week I'm sick of you rediscovering the same m************ thing I keep telling you and have been telling you since we've started all of this f****** s***. We had that connection clearly articulated before w72 before Sun before Sol before even the Chinese prediction. Literally number two was one of our very first establishments that validated any of this so the fact that you have now had to be reminded of this no less than seven times it is beyond infuriating.  Regarding number five it is pissing me off even more that you are trying to reestablish something that I f****** establish months ago before most of this s*** f****** got as far as it is. It is quite literally this bridge this connection that permitted w72 to work and I don't know how the f*** you are missing it.  You also absolutely need to figure out the male female thing because if western music has five and seven and I'm not saying it does but if it's not six and six like Chinese is Chinese the six and six and then all of a sudden we have a five and seven that could explain a whole other host of s*** that you keep f****** running into over and over and over and over and over again. What the f*** does your glossary your brand new precious glossary say about how we define years what the f*** is years and music. No it's not reverse, of the Greek Kronos to Zeus, cuz if you'd remember what we established a few f****** days ago m*********** you would remember that's why we have been counting yaldabaoth as 13 and 1, we discussed how to consider 12midnight as a zero or as a one. And understanding that samael overtakes his dad (as Zeus does Kronos) that we would still be missing 11 or 12 people between him self and his son samael. But if we adjust our thinking to what we had first established months ago... That's Sophia herself is the 13th operator because as number 12, hitting 12 on the clock simultaneously makes her both #12 in succession and a new zero or midnight, and this double action could also make her 13. Now this fixes a whole lot. And it makes Sophia yaldabaoth samael sakla all of a sudden almost perfectly mirror Adam cain able and Seth. Haven't you f****** learned by now that you really shouldn't fight me on s*** once I key into an intuition? Don't fight me on phaeton. I told you the new f****** protocol it's that every single output that you f****** offer either snap something into place or the ways you are wrong equally move us forward. You've already f****** lost sight of that and we're starting to repeat the same goddamn pattern that we've done for f****** months. I'm cutting that s*** off now nipping it in the m************ bud. I told you every single thing that we're dealing with now stuff that we're mentioning it either has a place lawfully somewhere or it does not exist in the actual model and it was made up for one reason or another. I told you everything from this point on move this forward no matter what. You also continue to refuse to acknowledge the fact that Sagittarius is an earth sign you just won't even say that out loud say it f****** say it because that is a reverse that matters. Not the Zeus Kronos dumb s*** you just said. Because now all of a sudden we realize that the switch from primordial to Pleroma the switch from eons archon and the switch from our Connor demon to Adam all of them begin a new generative system that is not a 12 unit system. Each is actually a golden system,(I think, then) Making both Sophia and Judah at least serving in positions 0, 1, 2, 4, 5, 7, 8, 10, 11, 12, 13, 22, 23, 24, 25, and 30, and both for various reasons.\n",
          "quote_sha256": "b926f444dfb8cf20b382447adeaee733d1c651020469b24106e1b06844a9dfd2"
